WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.000
An outlier drags the mean, but hardly moves the median.

2
00:00:04.726 --> 00:00:08.851
Five students get five to eight dollars. One gets forty.

3
00:00:09.379 --> 00:00:14.004
The mean is twelve, more than most get. The median is six and a half.

4
00:00:14.733 --> 00:00:18.233
With an outlier, the median is the better description.
